Update lifestyle facts for a user.

Upserts facts into UserMemoryFact (domain+key unique per user).

Example payload:
{
    "user_id": 1,
    "entries": [
        {
            "domain": "lifestyle",
            "key": "sleep_duration_hours",
            "value": 6.5,
            "confidence": 0.8,
            "source": "manual"
        },
        {
            "domain": "lifestyle",
            "key": "hydration_ml",
            "value": 1200,
            "confidence": 0.7,
            "source": "manual"
        }
    ]
}
